Wait — SET_DESIGN_TOKEN B field is `valueType` (not shifted). From spec: A=arenaRef path, B=valueType, C=value. In the Rust Guest::set_design_token: `Opcode::new(category::STYLE, style::SET_DESIGN_TOKEN, 0, arena_ref, u32::from(value_type), value)`. So B = valueType directly (not shifted). Good. And the HTML renderer reads `(op.b() & 0xFF) as u8` as valueType. So B = valueType.

Note the valueType for STRING is 0x05. encodeBits for a Color returns argb. Let me check ValueEncoder.encodeBits handles Color and Float.

