Fallback defaults (concrete, mirror HTML-ish):
- color.background: 0xFFFFFFFF / dark 0xFF0F172A
- color.primary: 0xFF2563EB / dark 0xFF60A5FA
- color.surface: 0xFFFFFFFF / dark 0xFF111827
- color.text.primary: 0xFF111827 / dark 0xFFF9FAFB
- color.text.secondary: 0xFF6B7280 / dark 0xFF9CA3AF
- color.text.onPrimary: 0xFFFFFFFF / dark 0xFF0F172A
- color.border: 0xFFE5E7EB / dark 0xFF374151
