This re-reads after get_or_create. It's cheap (cloned). This ensures the first node's update uses post-enrichment values. Good.

Let me apply that.

5. Another subtlety: `HostNode` PartialEq — token_refs field added; any tests doing full node equality? I don't think so.

Let me make the sync_node fix.

